<html lang='en'>
    <head>
        <meta charset='UTF-8' />
        <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
        <title>Workspace Deletion Notification</title>
        <style>
            body {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                background-color: #f4f4f7;
                color: #333333;
            }
            .container {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 24px;
                background-color: #ffffff;
                border-radius: 8px;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            }
            .header {
                margin-bottom: 24px;
                border-bottom: 3px solid #dc3545;
                padding-bottom: 16px;
            }
            .header h2 {
                margin: 0;
                color: #dc3545;
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .content {
                margin: 24px 0;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }
            .workspace-name {
                font-weight: bold;
                color: #007bff;
                font-size: 18px;
            }
            .footer {
                margin-top: 24px;
                padding-top: 16px;
                border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #999999;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class='container'>
            <div class='header'>
                <h2>Workspace Deleted</h2>
            </div>
            <div class='content'>
                <p>Hello,</p>
                <p>We are writing to inform you that the workspace
                    <span class='workspace-name'>"{{workspaceName}}"</span>
                    has been permanently deleted.</p>
                <p>All associated data, tasks, and documents in this workspace
                    are no longer accessible.</p>
                <p>If you believe this was done in error or have any questions,
                    please contact the workspace administrator.</p>
            </div>
            <div class='footer'>
                <p>Best regards,<br />Task Manager Team</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>